• Use Postman (or Swagger) and test in this order. Your API base URL is:

  http://localhost:3000

  First run the automated checks:

  npm test -- --runInBand
  npm run build

  Then test the API manually.

  ## 1. Health check

  GET http://localhost:3000/

  Expected: a successful hello response.

